                % parent_path,
                "      (read as %r). Actions then names that workflow after its PATH," % parent_name,
                "      so this publisher's workflow_run.workflows entry matches nothing",
                "      and every delivery from the %s parent is orphaned — silently," % role,
                "      because a workflow that never fires looks identical to one that",
                "      fires and finds nothing to do. A missing parent name: must trip",
