            "      workflow_run matches on the exact top-level name, so a rename on",
            "      either side orphans every delivery from that parent silently.")
    else:
        # Cross-check the literals the pinned conditions compare against.
        # A4a pins the conditions verbatim, so this fires only when the
        # parent files and `workflows:` were renamed together while the
