# the sharper half. `needs: open` on `publish` leaves every value this fence
# reads unchanged, and on a `completed` delivery `open`'s own condition is
# false — a skipped dependency skips its dependent, so the publish pass never
# runs and every hold phase 1 opened stays pending forever (cross-agent P1 on
# #974).
for key, job in ((OPEN_JOB, open_job), (PUBLISH_JOB, publish_job)):
    if job is None:
